ENGLISH
The source code, texts, layout and images in this repository are protected
by copyright. No licence is granted: any reproduction, modification,
redistribution or reuse, in whole or in part, is prohibited without the
author's prior written permission. Viewing the website online remains free.

The family members' avatars and photos embedded in the site are personal:
they may not be copied, reused or distributed outside this site.

The sky map uses star and constellation data from d3-celestial
(Olaf Frohn, BSD-3-Clause licence, based on the Hipparcos catalogue).

Weather data shown comes from third-party services and remains subject to
their own licences (Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0 data; geo.api.gouv.fr, INSEE data
under the Etalab Open Licence).
